{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30652","headline":"风不鸣条 · 姚鹄","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾君理化清，上瑞报时平。\n晓吹何曾歇，柔条自不鸣。\n花香知暗度，柳动觉潜生。\n只见低垂影，那闻击触声。\n大王初溥畅，少女正轻盈。\n幸遇无私力，幽芳愿发荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}